+//! Stage genome metadata and low-authority decision contracts.
+//!
+//! This module defines the stable names and audit rules for RedlineDB's
+//! engineered-intelligence stage system.  A stage is a replaceable decision
+//! surface, not a plugin with authority over durable state.  The host engine
+//! still owns page layout, WAL ordering, MVCC visibility, commit publication,
+//! catalog epochs, and SQL semantics.
+//!
+//! The first integration step is intentionally metadata-only: agents can target
+//! stable [`StageKind`] values and the benchmark harness can audit composed
+//! genomes before runtime hooks are wired into hot paths.
+
